<SI_DATA><SID_NAME>description</SID_NAME><SID_DATA>This Security Requirements Guide is published as a tool to improve the security of Department of Defense (DOD) information systems. The requirements are derived from the National Institute of Standards and Technology (NIST) 800-53 and related documents. Comments or proposed revisions to this document should be sent via email to the following address: disa.stig_spt@mail.mil.</SID_DATA></SI_DATA>
