<STATUS>Not_Reviewed</STATUS><FINDING_DETAILS>Flow control between interconnected systems (firewalls, network policy, cross-domain) is the platform's and site's. OpenTrack connects only to admin-configured sources, NATS, Redis, TAK outputs and the OTLP collector, each with TLS/mTLS options (docs/security/hardening.md#encrypt-every-link).</FINDING_DETAILS><COMMENTS>Site/Platform: interconnection flow control and ISAs</COMMENTS><SEVERITY_OVERRIDE></SEVERITY_OVERRIDE><SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION></SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION>
</VULN>
