<STIG_DATA><VULN_ATTRIBUTE>CCI_REF</VULN_ATTRIBUTE><ATTRIBUTE_DATA>CCI-000044</ATTRIBUTE_DATA></STIG_DATA>
<STATUS>NotAFinding</STATUS><FINDING_DETAILS>Three failed sign-ins within 15 minutes lock the account for 15 minutes; fixed constants LOCKOUT_FAILURES=3, LOCKOUT_WINDOW_MINUTES=15, LOCK_MINUTES=15 in crates/ot-server/src/auth/stig.rs, enforced in auth/api.rs login and audited as account_locked (docs/guides/admin.md#account-lockout).</FINDING_DETAILS><COMMENTS></COMMENTS><SEVERITY_OVERRIDE></SEVERITY_OVERRIDE><SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION></SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION>
