<STIG_DATA><VULN_ATTRIBUTE>CCI_REF</VULN_ATTRIBUTE><ATTRIBUTE_DATA>CCI-001464</ATTRIBUTE_DATA></STIG_DATA>
<STATUS>NotAFinding</STATUS><FINDING_DETAILS>Auditing is always on from process start: the audit chain is started when the database opens (crates/ot-store/src/audit.rs start_chain) and a sign-in that cannot be recorded is refused (docs/guides/admin.md#audit-record); there is no switch to turn it off.</FINDING_DETAILS><COMMENTS></COMMENTS><SEVERITY_OVERRIDE></SEVERITY_OVERRIDE><SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION></SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION>
