<STIG_DATA><VULN_ATTRIBUTE>CCI_REF</VULN_ATTRIBUTE><ATTRIBUTE_DATA>CCI-000130</ATTRIBUTE_DATA></STIG_DATA>
<STATUS>NotAFinding</STATUS><FINDING_DETAILS>Each audit row has an op field naming the event type (login, logout, account_locked, create_user, update_user, ...) (crates/ot-store/src/audit.rs AuditRow), also exported as the op attribute of the audit.record log event.</FINDING_DETAILS><COMMENTS></COMMENTS><SEVERITY_OVERRIDE></SEVERITY_OVERRIDE><SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION></SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION>
