<STATUS>NotAFinding</STATUS><FINDING_DETAILS>Sign-in events record the client address (ip) and the method (via: password, saml, certificate) in the audit row (crates/ot-server/src/auth/api.rs, crates/ot-store/src/audit.rs); decisions record the actor account.</FINDING_DETAILS><COMMENTS></COMMENTS><SEVERITY_OVERRIDE></SEVERITY_OVERRIDE><SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION></SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION>
