<STIG_DATA><VULN_ATTRIBUTE>CCI_REF</VULN_ATTRIBUTE><ATTRIBUTE_DATA>CCI-000134</ATTRIBUTE_DATA></STIG_DATA>
<STATUS>NotAFinding</STATUS><FINDING_DETAILS>Each audit row has an outcome field (success or failure) and, for refusals, the reason in detail (crates/ot-store/src/audit.rs append; docs/guides/admin.md#audit-record example).</FINDING_DETAILS><COMMENTS></COMMENTS><SEVERITY_OVERRIDE></SEVERITY_OVERRIDE><SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION></SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION>
