<STATUS>NotAFinding</STATUS><FINDING_DETAILS>Every audit row is emitted, once committed, as log event audit.record (crates/ot-store/src/audit.rs log_pending) and exported over OTLP (TLS/mTLS) to the site's collector/SIEM when OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT is set (crates/ot-server/src/telemetry.rs; docs/guides/admin.md#opentelemetry; docs/security/hardening.md#operate).</FINDING_DETAILS><COMMENTS>Site: configure the collector endpoint and SIEM routing</COMMENTS><SEVERITY_OVERRIDE></SEVERITY_OVERRIDE><SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION></SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION>
