<STATUS>NotAFinding</STATUS><FINDING_DETAILS>OpenTrack's audit tools (audit query, CSV export and chain verification) are built into the binary and exposed only to admins (crates/ot-server/src/audit_api.rs; auth/policy.rs); their use is itself audited (audit_export, audit_verify). SIEM tools are the site's.</FINDING_DETAILS><COMMENTS></COMMENTS><SEVERITY_OVERRIDE></SEVERITY_OVERRIDE><SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION></SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION>
