<STATUS>Not_Reviewed</STATUS><FINDING_DETAILS>Platform configuration files are the platform's. In the image, OpenTrack's own configuration (OpenSSL FIPS config, profiles, binary) is root-owned under a read-only root file system and the process runs as uid 1000 (Dockerfile; docker-compose.yml); .env on the host is the site's to protect.</FINDING_DETAILS><COMMENTS>Platform/Site: platform config files and the compose .env permissions</COMMENTS><SEVERITY_OVERRIDE></SEVERITY_OVERRIDE><SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION></SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION>
