<STATUS>Not_Reviewed</STATUS><FINDING_DETAILS>Platform authentication files are the platform's. OpenTrack writes session.key and initial-admin.txt readable by their owner only (crates/ot-server/src/auth/mod.rs mode 0600; docs/guides/admin.md#security); TLS keys are supplied by the site.</FINDING_DETAILS><COMMENTS>Platform/Site: key and certificate file permissions</COMMENTS><SEVERITY_OVERRIDE></SEVERITY_OVERRIDE><SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION></SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION>
</VULN>
