<STATUS>Not_Reviewed</STATUS><FINDING_DETAILS>Components installed on the platform are the platform's. The OpenTrack image is minimal: debian bookworm-slim with only ca-certificates, libxmlsec1, libxmlsec1-openssl and libxml2 added, one binary (Dockerfile); build tools stay in build stages.</FINDING_DETAILS><COMMENTS>Platform: platform component inventory</COMMENTS><SEVERITY_OVERRIDE></SEVERITY_OVERRIDE><SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION></SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION>
