<STATUS>NotAFinding</STATUS><FINDING_DETAILS>OpenTrack listens on non-privileged port 8090 by default (Dockerfile EXPOSE 8090; OT_BIND), runs as uid 1000 with all capabilities dropped (docker-compose.yml cap_drop ALL), so it cannot bind ports below 1024. Platform-wide enforcement is the platform's.</FINDING_DETAILS><COMMENTS>Platform: disallow privileged ports for all containers</COMMENTS><SEVERITY_OVERRIDE></SEVERITY_OVERRIDE><SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION></SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION>
</VULN>
<VULN>
