<STATUS>Not_Reviewed</STATUS><FINDING_DETAILS>Node identification in the cluster is the platform's. OpenTrack supports mutual TLS to NATS, Redis, feeds and the collector and CA-validated client certificates on its API (docs/security/hardening.md#encrypt-every-link); multi-node networking is an external package (docs/multi-node.md).</FINDING_DETAILS><COMMENTS>Platform: node identity/authentication</COMMENTS><SEVERITY_OVERRIDE></SEVERITY_OVERRIDE><SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION></SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION>
