<STATUS>NotAFinding</STATUS><FINDING_DETAILS>PASSWORD_MIN_LENGTH=15 (crates/ot-server/src/auth/stig.rs), enforced by auth/password.rs check on every set/change, including OT_ADMIN_PASSWORD (docs/guides/admin.md#password-policy).</FINDING_DETAILS><COMMENTS></COMMENTS><SEVERITY_OVERRIDE></SEVERITY_OVERRIDE><SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION></SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION>
