If the container platform does not enforce password complexity by requiring that at least one special character be used, this is a finding.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA></STIG_DATA>
<STIG_DATA><VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Fix_Text</VULN_ATTRIBUTE><ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Configure the container platform to enforce password complexity by requiring that at least one special character be used.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA></STIG_DATA>
