<STATUS>NotAFinding</STATUS><FINDING_DETAILS>Client certificates validated to the configured CA (OT_TLS_CLIENT_CA) with CRL checking that fails closed (OT_TLS_CLIENT_CRL) are mapped by subject CN to an individual account (crates/ot-server/src/https.rs; docs/guides/admin.md#client-certificates). OCSP is not supported (roadmap #21).</FINDING_DETAILS><COMMENTS></COMMENTS><SEVERITY_OVERRIDE></SEVERITY_OVERRIDE><SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION></SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION>
