<STATUS>NotAFinding</STATUS><FINDING_DETAILS>Every password field in the UI is an input of type=password (ui/src/auth/LoginPage.tsx, PasswordChangeScreen.tsx, UserChip.tsx); sign-in failures give one generic message whatever the reason.</FINDING_DETAILS><COMMENTS></COMMENTS><SEVERITY_OVERRIDE></SEVERITY_OVERRIDE><SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION></SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION>
