<STIG_DATA><VULN_ATTRIBUTE>CCI_REF</VULN_ATTRIBUTE><ATTRIBUTE_DATA>CCI-001190</ATTRIBUTE_DATA></STIG_DATA>
<STATUS>Not_Reviewed</STATUS><FINDING_DETAILS>Fail-secure behaviour of the runtime is the platform's. OpenTrack itself stops if the FIPS module fails its self-tests (crates/ot-server/src/fips.rs init) and refuses sign-in when the audit record can't be written (docs/guides/admin.md#audit-record).</FINDING_DETAILS><COMMENTS>Platform: container runtime failure handling</COMMENTS><SEVERITY_OVERRIDE></SEVERITY_OVERRIDE><SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION></SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION>
