<STATUS>Not_Reviewed</STATUS><FINDING_DETAILS>Preserving failure information is the platform's (container logs, restarts). OpenTrack logs to standard output (JSON with OT_LOG_FORMAT=json) and over OTLP, reports health (HEALTHCHECK opentrack health, /api/v1/status) and keeps state on /data (docs/guides/admin.md#monitoring).</FINDING_DETAILS><COMMENTS>Platform: container log retention</COMMENTS><SEVERITY_OVERRIDE></SEVERITY_OVERRIDE><SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION></SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION>
