<STATUS>Not_Reviewed</STATUS><FINDING_DETAILS>Protection of memory, storage, kernel and network between containers and users is the platform's. OpenTrack's shipped compose uses host networking (see V-233127).</FINDING_DETAILS><COMMENTS>Platform: container isolation</COMMENTS><SEVERITY_OVERRIDE></SEVERITY_OVERRIDE><SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION></SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION>
