<STIG_DATA><VULN_ATTRIBUTE>CCI_REF</VULN_ATTRIBUTE><ATTRIBUTE_DATA>CCI-004045</ATTRIBUTE_DATA></STIG_DATA>
<STATUS>Not_Applicable</STATUS><FINDING_DETAILS>OpenTrack has no shared or group accounts: every credential (password, API token, client certificate mapping) belongs to one individual account and can be revoked individually (docs/guides/admin.md#users).</FINDING_DETAILS><COMMENTS></COMMENTS><SEVERITY_OVERRIDE></SEVERITY_OVERRIDE><SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION></SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION>
