<STIG_DATA><VULN_ATTRIBUTE>CCI_REF</VULN_ATTRIBUTE><ATTRIBUTE_DATA>CCI-002233</ATTRIBUTE_DATA></STIG_DATA>
<STATUS>NotAFinding</STATUS><FINDING_DETAILS>The image runs as unprivileged uid 1000 (Dockerfile USER opentrack) and docker-compose.yml runs it with cap_drop: [ALL], security_opt no-new-privileges:true and read_only: true (docs/security/hardening.md 'Run it hardened', docs/guides/admin.md#container-hardening). Blocking other privileged workloads is the platform's job; note the sample compose uses network_mode: host only to reach loopback Redis/NATS, which a platform may replace with a bridged network.</FINDING_DETAILS><COMMENTS></COMMENTS><SEVERITY_OVERRIDE></SEVERITY_OVERRIDE><SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION></SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION>
</VULN>
