<STATUS>NotAFinding</STATUS><FINDING_DETAILS>Three failed sign-ins within 15 minutes lock the account until an administrator unlocks it (stig::LOCK_UNTIL_UNLOCKED, fixed; crates/ot-server/src/auth/stig.rs and api.rs login; audited as account_locked); unlock in Settings -&gt; Users, the API or opentrack user unlock on the server (docs/guides/admin.md#account-lockout).</FINDING_DETAILS><COMMENTS></COMMENTS><SEVERITY_OVERRIDE></SEVERITY_OVERRIDE><SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION></SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION>
