<STATUS>Not_Reviewed</STATUS><FINDING_DETAILS>Installing an OpenTrack update means pulling and running a new image, which requires privileged access to the container host/platform; OpenTrack cannot update itself (docs/guides/admin.md#upgrades).</FINDING_DETAILS><COMMENTS>Platform: runtime/registry privileges for image updates</COMMENTS><SEVERITY_OVERRIDE></SEVERITY_OVERRIDE><SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION></SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION>
