<STATUS>NotAFinding</STATUS><FINDING_DETAILS>Cached authentication state is time-bounded: sessions are server-side records ending at 15/10 min idle and 24 h absolute; an OpenStare identity check is cached for 30 seconds; client CRLs past their next update refuse every certificate (fail closed); API tokens expire at the admin-set lifetime (docs/guides/admin.md#session-limits, #openstare-sign-in, #client-certificates).</FINDING_DETAILS><COMMENTS></COMMENTS><SEVERITY_OVERRIDE></SEVERITY_OVERRIDE><SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION></SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION>
