<STATUS>NotAFinding</STATUS><FINDING_DETAILS>Revocation data is read from a local directory of CRLs (OT_TLS_CLIENT_CRL), reloaded when files change, so validation does not depend on network access at sign-in; a stale list fails closed (crates/ot-server/src/https.rs reload_on_crl_change; docs/guides/admin.md#client-certificates). OCSP is not supported.</FINDING_DETAILS><COMMENTS></COMMENTS><SEVERITY_OVERRIDE></SEVERITY_OVERRIDE><SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION></SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION>
