<STATUS>NotAFinding</STATUS><FINDING_DETAILS>The UI/API (the only remote maintenance path) is served over TLS 1.2/1.3 from rustls' FIPS configuration on AWS-LC FIPS 3.0 (AES-GCM, HMAC-SHA256/384-based PRF/HKDF) (crates/ot-server/src/fips.rs, docs/security/fips.md); TLS is required by docs/security/hardening.md 'Encrypt every link'.</FINDING_DETAILS><COMMENTS></COMMENTS><SEVERITY_OVERRIDE></SEVERITY_OVERRIDE><SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION></SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION>
