<STATUS>NotAFinding</STATUS><FINDING_DETAILS>Web/API TLS offers only FIPS-approved AES-GCM suites via rustls' FIPS provider on the AWS-LC FIPS module; ChaCha20 is not offered (docs/security/fips.md 'What the process checks', crates/ot-server/src/fips.rs init).</FINDING_DETAILS><COMMENTS></COMMENTS><SEVERITY_OVERRIDE></SEVERITY_OVERRIDE><SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION></SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION>
