<STIG_DATA><VULN_ATTRIBUTE>CCI_REF</VULN_ATTRIBUTE><ATTRIBUTE_DATA>CCI-002450</ATTRIBUTE_DATA></STIG_DATA>
<STATUS>Not_Reviewed</STATUS><FINDING_DETAILS>Whether OpenTrack processes classified information depends on the deployment. It uses FIPS-validated AES-GCM/NIST-curve TLS but does not enforce a CNSA suite; NSA-approved (Type 1/CSfC) protection for classified networks is provided by the site's network encryption.</FINDING_DETAILS><COMMENTS>Site: classification of the deployment and NSA-approved network encryption</COMMENTS><SEVERITY_OVERRIDE></SEVERITY_OVERRIDE><SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION></SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION>
