<STATUS>NotAFinding</STATUS><FINDING_DETAILS>Data is serialized and sent only over TLS-protected connections when configured per docs/security/hardening.md; outgoing tracks are published to NATS over tls:// with optional mTLS (docs/guides/admin.md#encryption-in-transit). No plaintext staging outside the process.</FINDING_DETAILS><COMMENTS></COMMENTS><SEVERITY_OVERRIDE></SEVERITY_OVERRIDE><SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION></SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION>
