<STIG_DATA><VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Vuln_Discuss</VULN_ATTRIBUTE><ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Information either can be unintentionally or maliciously disclosed or modified during reception for reception within the container platform during aggregation, at protocol transformation points, and during container image runtime. These unauthorized disclosures or modifications compromise the confidentiality or integrity of the information. When receiving data, the container platform components need to leverage protection mechanisms, such as TLS, TLS VPNs, or IPsec.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA></STIG_DATA>
