<STIG_DATA><VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Fix_Text</VULN_ATTRIBUTE><ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Configure the container platform to maintain the confidentiality and integrity using mechanisms such as TLS, TLS VPNs, or IPsec during reception.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA></STIG_DATA>
