<STATUS>Not_Reviewed</STATUS><FINDING_DETAILS>Verifying security functions is a site role/process. OpenTrack provides GET /api/v1/audit/verify (hash chain), FIPS self-tests at start, and GET /api/v1/status (docs/guides/admin.md#audit-record, #health-checks).</FINDING_DETAILS><COMMENTS>Site: ISSO/SA verification procedure</COMMENTS><SEVERITY_OVERRIDE></SEVERITY_OVERRIDE><SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION></SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION>
