<STATUS>Not_Reviewed</STATUS><FINDING_DETAILS>OpenTrack reports anomalies in its security functions as log events (FIPS failure stops the process, a broken audit chain logs an error in crates/ot-server/src/audit_api.rs, CRL load failures, OpenTelemetry export failing) and red rows in Overview -&gt; System status; delivering notifications to the SA and staff is the site monitoring/SIEM's.</FINDING_DETAILS><COMMENTS>Site: monitoring/SIEM notification</COMMENTS><SEVERITY_OVERRIDE></SEVERITY_OVERRIDE><SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION></SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION>
