If audit records are not generated, this is a finding.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA></STIG_DATA>
<STIG_DATA><VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Fix_Text</VULN_ATTRIBUTE><ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Configure the container platform to generate audit records when successful/unsuccessful attempts are made to modify categories of information.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA></STIG_DATA>
