<STATUS>NotAFinding</STATUS><FINDING_DETAILS>Privileged activities (all admin and track_manager changes, account and token management, unlock, audit export and verify) are recorded with actor, time, outcome and before/after (record_decision in crates/ot-store/src/sqlite.rs, crates/ot-server/src/audit_api.rs).</FINDING_DETAILS><COMMENTS></COMMENTS><SEVERITY_OVERRIDE></SEVERITY_OVERRIDE><SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION></SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION>
