<STATUS>NotAFinding</STATUS><FINDING_DETAILS>All hashing (audit chain SHA-256, PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA256, HMAC token signatures, plugin SHA-256) uses the AWS-LC FIPS 140-3 module (aws_lc_rs::digest in crates/ot-store/src/audit.rs; docs/security/fips.md); the process refuses to start outside FIPS mode.</FINDING_DETAILS><COMMENTS></COMMENTS><SEVERITY_OVERRIDE></SEVERITY_OVERRIDE><SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION></SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION>
