<STATUS>NotAFinding</STATUS><FINDING_DETAILS>Server and client certificates are validated with rustls' WebPKI verifiers (RFC 5280 path validation to configured roots, client CRL status, fail closed) (crates/ot-source/src/tls.rs, crates/ot-server/src/https.rs). The per-feed insecure_skip_verify option is excluded from accredited deployments by docs/security/hardening.md (F-4).</FINDING_DETAILS><COMMENTS></COMMENTS><SEVERITY_OVERRIDE></SEVERITY_OVERRIDE><SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION></SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION>
