<STIG_DATA><VULN_ATTRIBUTE>TargetKey</VULN_ATTRIBUTE><ATTRIBUTE_DATA>5239</ATTRIBUTE_DATA></STIG_DATA>
<STIG_DATA><VULN_ATTRIBUTE>STIG_UUID</VULN_ATTRIBUTE><ATTRIBUTE_DATA>4bb4bb69-ac34-5cad-97bd-692cd86cae08</ATTRIBUTE_DATA></STIG_DATA>
<STIG_DATA><VULN_ATTRIBUTE>CCI_REF</VULN_ATTRIBUTE><ATTRIBUTE_DATA>CCI-002145</ATTRIBUTE_DATA></STIG_DATA>
<STATUS>Not_Reviewed</STATUS><FINDING_DETAILS>The organization defines the usage conditions. OpenTrack enforces: break-glass accounts exempt only from inactivity, SSO-only accounts (no password), per-token expiry, SAML role mapping with Allow admin off, password sign-in can be turned off (docs/guides/admin.md#users, #sign-in).</FINDING_DETAILS><COMMENTS>Site: ISSO defines account usage conditions</COMMENTS><SEVERITY_OVERRIDE></SEVERITY_OVERRIDE><SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION></SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION>
</VULN>
<VULN>
<STIG_DATA><VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Vuln_Num</VULN_ATTRIBUTE><ATTRIBUTE_DATA>V-263586</ATTRIBUTE_DATA></STIG_DATA>
<STIG_DATA><VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Severity</VULN_ATTRIBUTE><ATTRIBUTE_DATA>medium</ATTRIBUTE_DATA></STIG_DATA>
<STIG_DATA><VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Group_Title</VULN_ATTRIBUTE><ATTRIBUTE_DATA>SRG-APP-000705</ATTRIBUTE_DATA></STIG_DATA>
<STIG_DATA><VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Rule_ID</VULN_ATTRIBUTE><ATTRIBUTE_DATA>SV-263586r982453_rule</ATTRIBUTE_DATA></STIG_DATA>
<STIG_DATA><VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Rule_Ver</VULN_ATTRIBUTE><ATTRIBUTE_DATA>SRG-APP-000705-CTR-000110</ATTRIBUTE_DATA></STIG_DATA>
<STIG_DATA><VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Rule_Title</VULN_ATTRIBUTE><ATTRIBUTE_DATA>The container platform must disable accounts when the accounts are no longer associated to a user.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA></STIG_DATA>
<STIG_DATA><VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Vuln_Discuss</VULN_ATTRIBUTE><ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Disabling expired, inactive, or otherwise anomalous accounts supports the concepts of least privilege and least functionality which reduce the attack surface of the system.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA></STIG_DATA>
