<STIG_DATA><VULN_ATTRIBUTE>CCI_REF</VULN_ATTRIBUTE><ATTRIBUTE_DATA>CCI-004046</ATTRIBUTE_DATA></STIG_DATA>
<STATUS>NotAFinding</STATUS><FINDING_DETAILS>Multifactor access with a separate-device factor is available through CAC/PKI client certificates over mutual TLS and through a SAML IdP enforcing MFA; password sign-in can be disabled leaving only break-glass local admins (docs/guides/admin.md#client-certificates, #saml, #password-sign-in).</FINDING_DETAILS><COMMENTS></COMMENTS><SEVERITY_OVERRIDE></SEVERITY_OVERRIDE><SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION></SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION>
</VULN>
