<STATUS>Open</STATUS><FINDING_DETAILS>OpenTrack's password check enforces length and character classes only; there is no list of commonly used, expected or compromised passwords (crates/ot-server/src/auth/password.rs check()).</FINDING_DETAILS><COMMENTS>Add a compromised/common password list (e.g. NIST SP 800-63B blocklist) checked in password::check, shipped with the image, admin-replaceable and refreshed per org frequency.</COMMENTS><SEVERITY_OVERRIDE></SEVERITY_OVERRIDE><SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION></SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION>
</VULN>
