<STIG_DATA><VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Rule_Title</VULN_ATTRIBUTE><ATTRIBUTE_DATA>The container platform must protect nonlocal maintenance sessions by separating the maintenance session from other network sessions with the system by logically separated communications paths.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA></STIG_DATA>
<STIG_DATA><VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Vuln_Discuss</VULN_ATTRIBUTE><ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Nonlocal maintenance and diagnostic activities are conducted by individuals who communicate through either an external or internal network.
