If the container platform is not configured to protect nonlocal maintenance sessions by separating the maintenance session from other network sessions with the system by logically separated communications paths, this is a finding.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA></STIG_DATA>
<STIG_DATA><VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Fix_Text</VULN_ATTRIBUTE><ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Configure the container platform to protect nonlocal maintenance sessions by separating the maintenance session from other network sessions with the system by logically separated communications paths.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA></STIG_DATA>
