<STATUS>Not_Reviewed</STATUS><FINDING_DETAILS>Protected/hardware key storage is the platform's (secrets store, HSM). OpenTrack reads TLS keys and OT_SESSION_SECRET from files/environment the platform can supply and writes session.key owner-readable on /data (docs/security/hardening.md step 5).</FINDING_DETAILS><COMMENTS>Platform: secrets management / HSM</COMMENTS><SEVERITY_OVERRIDE></SEVERITY_OVERRIDE><SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION></SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION>
