<STATUS>NotAFinding</STATUS><FINDING_DETAILS>docker-compose.yml runs the container with read_only: true and tmpfs for /tmp and /home/opentrack, /data being the only writable volume (docs/security/hardening.md 'Run it hardened', docs/guides/admin.md#container-hardening).</FINDING_DETAILS><COMMENTS></COMMENTS><SEVERITY_OVERRIDE></SEVERITY_OVERRIDE><SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION></SEVERITY_JUSTIFICATION>
